# Binary assets (images, sounds, music, icons, editable art sources and the full-resolution art masters
# in tools/asset_gen/masters) live in Git LFS. Install git-lfs before cloning (see INSTALL), or the game
# data checks out as LFS pointer files. Extensions match in any case (explosion3.WAV).
